// Deepslate Works (Alex, 2026-10-20): no Critters and Companions snails; Naturalist's snail (shells, shellstone) is the
// pack's snail. Every other key is the mod's default: YACL starts from the defaults and reads only what is here, then
// writes the full file back. configVersion 2 is the mod's current one, so it runs no migration.
{
  "configVersion": 2,
  "spawning": {
    "snail": []
  }
}
